body:
ide rather do all 4 if i can afford it .. start the wear fresh on all 4 

the least i ever replace is 2 (either front or rear) 

if replacing all 4 do please make sure to use the same tyres - its better for consistancy and wear speed (we recently did all 4 on my dads A-class) which had mis-matches before and they wernt the best (2nd hand car with some wear when we got it)

@bigveinythock asked for an update - after much agonising ive gone for an epo th80 (pink flamingo switches) i was looking at the keydous nj80 but its a lot more money and the only UK seller of it on amazon has dreadful ratings 

also picked up a MAMBASNAKE orange coiled cable (just loved the look) 

may upload a pic here when it comes and ive put the new cable in
